# 1. Client requirements

Katlego Adult Learning Centre is a small institution with no dedicated IT staff on site. It needs a network that keeps its classrooms, computer lab, admin office and server room apart, and that keeps working without an IT department.

## Requirements covered in Milestone 2

| ID | Requirement | Where it is met |
|----|-------------|-----------------|
| FR2 | Separate VLANs for each part of the centre | configs/ (Layer 2 and Layer 3 sections) |
| FR4 | Port Security on every access port (assigned technical challenge) | configs/ switch files, test 5 |
| FR5 | Server room and infrastructure reachable by authorised staff only | ACL 100 in configs/KATLEGO-RTR.txt, tests 3 and 4 |
| FR6 / CR11 | VoIP handsets on their own segment | Voice VLAN 40 on SW3 Fa0/6, test 7 |

